# FoodExpress .gitignore
#
# CONTAINS BUGS - Find and fix them!
#
# BUG 1: Missing node_modules/ - will commit all npm packages (huge!)
# BUG 2: Missing .env - will expose secrets (DB passwords, API keys)
# BUG 3: Missing *.log - will commit log files that change constantly

# Java
*.class
*.jar
target/

# IDE files
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# BUG 1: node_modules/ is NOT listed!
# All 500+ MB of npm packages will be committed to the repository.
# This makes the repo huge and slow to clone.

# BUG 2: .env is NOT listed!
# Files like .env contain database passwords, API keys, and secrets.
# Committing .env exposes sensitive credentials in version control.

# BUG 3: *.log is NOT listed!
# Log files change with every run and add noise to commits.
# They should be excluded from version control.

# Build output
dist/
build/

# Docker
docker-compose.override.yml
